<title>USA: CoCensys names Nichol president, CEO.</title>
<headline>CoCensys names Nichol president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>CoCensys Inc said it named F. Richard Nichol president and chief executive officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Officials at the company were not immediately available.</p>
<p>Nichol, 54, had formerly been president, chief executive and chairman of the clinical research company IBRD-Rostrum Global Inc. Prior to that he had been a senior research scientist at Upjohn, according to CoCensys.</p>
<p>Nichol replaces Daniel Korpolinski, who resigned in October.</p>
